---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<section id="contact" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:px-8">
  <div
    class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/60 p-8 sm:p-12 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/40"
    data-reveal
  >
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Get in touch</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
      I work remote and asynchronous, from La Paz on UTC-4, which overlaps a full US working day.
      The fastest way to reach me is email.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="mailto:joeljarro2@gmail.com" class="btn-primary">joeljarro2@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Quirrod" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joel-jarro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-10 text-center text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-600">
    © {year} Joel Jarro · Built with Astro and Tailwind
  </p>
</section>
